    <Label alignment="CENTER" prefHeight="318.0" prefWidth="1318.0" styleClass="message-label" text="&quot;We are Ierussi Flowers &amp; Partners, an agricultural company, with roots dating back to 1990. Since then, we have cultivated a passion for the land and nature, which has guided us in our growth and transformation over the years. In 2016, we expanded our scope of activity, dedicating ourselves to floriculture with commitment and dedication. With the passage of time, our company has evolved, combining tradition with innovation to offer a wide range of high quality flowers and plants quality. In 2023, we officially adopted the name Ierussi Flowers &amp; Partners, symbolizing our agricultural heritage and love for the flowers we carefully grow. We constantly strive to bring beauty and freshness to your spaces, offering unique and quality floral products high quality. Our many years of experience in the sector allows us to satisfy the needs of our customers with passion and competence. We stand out for our attention to detail, the quality of our products and the love for what we do. We are proud to share our story and our passion with you, bringing a touch of nature and color into your daily life. Welcome to the world of Ierussi Flowers &amp; Partners, where the beauty of nature comes to life through our flowers.&quot;" textAlignment="CENTER" wrapText="true" />
